sfmach:hostsOperation a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "hostsOperation" ;
    rdfs:comment "Named hostsOperation, not performsOperation, to avoid a real name collision found live: sf:performsOperation already existed (Order->Operation, schema-only, unused) as the inverse of operationFor. Reusing the name for this unrelated Workstation->Operation relationship silently merged both domains via RDF triple accumulation, forcing any Workstation asserted here to also be inferred as an Order -- a real BFO-disjoint contradiction (Independent Continuant vs Generically Dependent Continuant) that made the whole ontology inconsistent under a real DL reasoner." ;
    rdfs:domain sfmach:Workstation ;
    rdfs:range sfmeth:Operation .

